  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Socioeconomi c Diagnosis Gender perspective in 21 rural communities in the municipality of El Viejo, Chinandega.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Para el Desarrollo Integral de la Mujer (APADIEM) IAF Grant: $41,283 over one year APADIEM will work with women in the municipality of El Viejo to assess the needs of their 21 rural communities and develop a plan identifying income- producing activities that will lead to economic independence and better living conditions. The project is expected to benefit 420 women directly and 2,100 other community residents indirectly. 18-</narrative>
